name: Mandate Activated
type: Coordination/Message
description: |
  Authoritative Message emitted after the inherited mandate workflow
  successfully changes the mandate from `Mandate/Status Authority Confirmed`
  to `Mandate/Status Active`.

  When activation follows Mandate Activation Requested, inResponseTo references
  that exact Message occurrence.

timestampUs:
  type: Integer
  schema:
    required: true
  description: Effective activation timestamp derived from the root causal Timeline Entry.
